      "A clean-looking status is not evidence that the underlying work is correct. A closed status is not proof that the destination changed. A short written rule is easier to test than an unwritten habit. Tie the close note to the original request and the final evidence. Apply the same ordering provider check coverage test to the reviewer note and to the value that survives in the claim file. At Outsourced Billing Services, the ordering provider check coverage queue marks a held claim with the reason it stopped and the person who can release it.",
      "## Limitations",
